<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96226" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στᾰλ-άσσω</span></b> , late <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στά̆λ-ττω</span></b>  (<i><span class="en">
			Porph.
			<u>in Harm.</u>
			p.195.10
		</span></i> W.): aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐστάλαξα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					37
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Mi.</u>
				2.11
			</span></i>: </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			<i>let drop</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάκρυ ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				633
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἐς οἶδμα . . δακρύων . . αὐγάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					738
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκηπτὸς ς . . . φόνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					1046
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠμιτύβιον
			σταλάσσον</span> a napkin <i>dripping wet</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
				116
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ἐν τῷ διαλέγεσθαι δυσφόρους καὶ
					κατ᾽ ὀλίγας λέξεις σταλάττοντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
				</span></i>
			 l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>drop, drip</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1388
			</span></i>.</div>
